<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Tiger Claw</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Ranger (guild level 21)
Mana: 10
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast tiger claw &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast tiger claw</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster swipes a hand at the target and mutters 'tagum felis', and 
the power of the tiger rakes them like claws. It is the ranger's attack 
spell: the better your divine power and your summoning sphere, the more it 
hurts. The claws care little what armour the target wears, and a shield 
only softens them.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while 
fighting, and no free hands are needed.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Eagle Cry</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summoning Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Ranger Spells</a>
</pre>




</div>